 "note": "getProcessor merges each text-format config into a fresh ConformanceConfig.Builder and builds it; a null baseConfiguration/extendingConfiguration leaves its builder empty. TextFormat.parse(text, ConformanceConfig.class) is protobuf's own newBuilderForType()+merge(text, builder)+build() (identical bytecode path to the test's TextFormat.merge into ConformanceConfig.newBuilder()), and an unset config is ConformanceConfig.newBuilder().build(), exactly as in the test. A ParseException surfaces as RuntimeException(cause) in both the test and the DSL. The class literal ConformanceConfig.class is written as Class.forName(name), since the DSL has no class-literal expression."
}
